--- zzz_at_healing_patch: Anomaly xr_eat_medkit.on_register bugfix.
---
--- Vanilla xr_eat_medkit.script:36-44 rolls math.random() > 0.5 to write healing_charge=true
--- on every server_entity_on_register fire. alife_storage_manager.cpp:160-161 re-fires
--- on_register for every restored entity on save load, so vanilla re-rolls per save load.
--- Consumed charges (cleared at xr_eat_medkit.script:223) can also get re-granted.
---
--- Unregister vanilla's callback. healing_charge is owned by at_healing._on_net_spawn.
--- Unconditional: the healing master toggle is live in at_healing's patched bodies, and leaving
--- vanilla's roll registered while the toggle is off would reintroduce the re-roll bug the moment
--- a save loads. With the toggle off, no charge rolls at all; previously granted charges persist.
---
--- zzz_ filename so this on_game_start runs after xr_eat_medkit.on_game_start.

function on_game_start()
    if not xr_eat_medkit or not xr_eat_medkit.on_register then return end
    UnregisterScriptCallback("server_entity_on_register", xr_eat_medkit.on_register)
    at_trace.info("[PATCH] xr_eat_medkit.on_register suppressed (vanilla save-load re-roll bug)")
end
